    // stops the surface reading as one airbrushed sheet: the 40 m layer carries
    // macro albedo variation across the massif, the 4 m layer is the working
    // stone, the 0.5 m layer survives a close camera.
    // Both stone tiles carry a standard deviation of only ~5% — straight from
